        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VHS&gt; Vermin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight through grotesque VHS nightmares with limited ammo and nowhere to hide in this arcade survival horror shooter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no escape, no cover, and no downtime — <strong>your only chance of survival is to destroy everything that moves. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience three standalone “movie segments” plus a wrap-around town sequence, each delivering its own gruesome horror scenario. Every environment oozes with VHS grime, retro 3D visuals, and classic exploitation-film style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“Now available in the VHS Horror Series Bundle – save 29% on Freaks + Vermin!”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Follow the Developer link on the sidebar &gt;&gt;&gt;</i><br> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203910/extras/6d274fa759cb7e84fa361f7aa88caa40.poster.avif?t=1778083264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203910/extras/6d274fa759cb7e84fa361f7aa88caa40.webm?t=1778083264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203910/extras/6d274fa759cb7e84fa361f7aa88caa40.mp4?t=1778083264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast arcade survival horror</strong><br>Shoot, dodge, reload — relentless pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armies of gore-drenched monstrosities</strong><br>Mutated spiders, slugs, worms, alien insects, twisted human abominations… and more waiting to be shredded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A complete retro horror experience</strong><br>Early-2000s style 3D graphics, VHS noise, film grain, and an atmospheric synth-driven soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three standalone horror scenarios + wrap-around story</strong><br>Each a brutal VHS nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret targets to hunt in every level</strong><br>Explore deeper and extend playtime by uncovering hidden objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unapologetic gore &amp; bloodshed</strong><br>Because that’s exactly what a VHS exploitation shooter <i>should</i> deliver.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203910/extras/bd3e9e1f06eec77ca839c386734faf03.poster.avif?t=1778083264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203910/extras/bd3e9e1f06eec77ca839c386734faf03.webm?t=1778083264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203910/extras/bd3e9e1f06eec77ca839c386734faf03.mp4?t=1778083264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Length</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Around 3 hours</strong>, depending on playstyle and how many hidden targets you track down. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Influences</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Doom 3, House of the Dead, Resident Evil</i> — with the pace and attitude of classic arcade horror shooters.</p>",
